WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.290
In 70 CE, Roman armies destroyed
Jerusalem and its Temple.

2
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:08.700
Jews scattered: to
Babylonia, North Africa,

3
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.090
Spain, and across Europe.

4
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:15.000
For most of history, most
Jews lived outside the Land.

5
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.600
Their great centres of
learning grew far away,

6
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.690
in places like Babylonia.

7
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.170
So why did the Land stay
at the centre of Judaism?

8
00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:26.730
In this mission, you'll go back
to the promise made to Abraham,

9
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.530
and find out what makes the Land holy.

10
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:34.750
Then you'll trace two exiles, and weigh
up how central the Land really is.

11
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.240
Your mission: explain why the Land
stayed at the centre of Judaism.
